- **Estimated Timeline:** To lose 10 kg of fat mass at 0.7 kg/week: $\\frac{10}{0.72} \\approx 14\\text{ weeks}$.

#### Case 2: 75 kg Male at 12% Body Fat (Pre-Contest/Photo Shoot Cut to 8%)
