   - Average: 20% to 22%
   - High Adiposity: 25%
3. **Calculate Caloric Target:** Multiply your validated TDEE by $(1 - \\text{Deficit \\%})$.
4. **Establish Phase Duration:** Cap your active cutting phase at 12 to 16 continuous weeks. Prolonged energy restriction beyond 16 weeks warrants a 2-week maintenance diet break.
5. **Set Stop-Loss Guardrails:** If your rate of loss exceeds 1.2% of body mass per week for two consecutive weeks, increase your daily intake by 150 kcal immediately to protect muscle tissue.

