### Introduction
The greatest nutritional blueprint in existence is useless if you cannot execute it consistently 365 days a year. Many lifters fail to build muscle not because they lack discipline, but because their meal prep strategy is chaotic, their tracking methods are wildly inaccurate, or they choose foods so filling that eating in a surplus feels like torture. By implementing systematic meal planning, accurate measurement protocols, and smart food selection, eating for muscle growth becomes effortless and automatic.

### Learning Objectives
