- **Meal 3 (Pre-Workout Snack - 16:00)**: 2 slices sourdough bread with 30g natural peanut butter, 1 scoop (30g) Whey Isolate in water, 1 apple. (540 kcal · 36g Protein · 65g Carbs · 16g Fat)
- **Meal 4 (Post-Workout Dinner - 19:30)**: 180g (raw weight) 93/7 ground beef, 350g baked potato with 10g butter, spinach salad with 10g olive oil. (760 kcal · 46g Protein · 75g Carbs · 28g Fat)
