- **Changing Intake Every 3 Days**: Reacting to daily scale fluctuations by frantically slashing or spiking calories; you must wait for the 14-day rolling trend to declare a true pattern.

### How to Measure Progress
- **Adherence Score**: Hitting your daily caloric target within +/- 100 kcal and protein within +/- 10 g on at least 6 out of 7 days each week.
