### Introduction
The sports supplement industry is a multi-billion dollar machine built largely on marketing hyperbole, proprietary blends, and fabricated testimonials. Countless products promise steroid-like muscle mass in a bottle, yet when subjected to rigorous peer-reviewed clinical trials, over 95% of commercial bodybuilding supplements perform no better than a placebo. To spend your money wisely, you must filter supplements through the lens of evidence-based science, focusing exclusively on **Tier 1 compounds that demonstrate indisputable, reproducible ergogenic efficacy**.

### Learning Objectives
- Explain the biochemical mechanism of Creatine Monohydrate in the phosphagen energy system.
