### Introduction
Walking into the gym without a periodized roadmap is the fastest way to stay looking identical year after year. Muscle hypertrophy does not respond to random workouts; it responds to **structured, systematic progression across time**. In sports science, periodization is the strategic planning of training variables (volume, intensity, frequency, and exercise selection) in sequential phases to achieve peak adaptation while preventing accommodation and overtraining.

### Learning Objectives
