### Detailed Explanation
Your 12-Week Hypertrophy Blueprint is structured using a linear accumulation periodization model:
- **Macrocycle**: The entire 12-week transformation journey.
- **Mesocycle 1 (Weeks 1 to 6 - Foundation & Accumulation)**: Establish baseline technique, determine exact starting loads at 3 RIR, and gradually increase weekly set volume from Minimum Effective Volume (MEV) to Maximum Adaptive Volume (MAV). Concludes with a Week 6 Deload.
- **Mesocycle 2 (Weeks 7 to 12 - Intensification & Overdrive)**: Resensitize muscle fibers with altered exercise variations, push sets to 1-0 RIR, and drive muscle fibers to Maximum Recoverable Volume (MRV). Concludes with Week 12 Final Testing & Deload.

