THE KAIZEN 4-PILLAR PLATEAU DIAGNOSTIC TREE
Is weight stalled across 3 consecutive sessions?
├── Pillar 1: Nutrition -> Are you in a true caloric surplus? Has scale weight gained 0.2-0.4 kg/week?
│   └── FIX: Add +200 kcal/day from easily digestible carbohydrates.
├── Pillar 2: Recovery -> Are you sleeping 7.5+ hours? Is life stress spiking cortisol?
│   └── FIX: Sleep audit; optimize bedtime; reduce non-training stressors.
├── Pillar 3: Fatigue -> Has it been 5+ weeks since your last deload? Do joints ache?
