| Stall Scenario | Probable Root Cause | Corrective Action |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **All lifts stalling simultaneously; mood low; morning RHR elevated** | Systemic CNS Fatigue / Non-Functional Overreaching | Take an immediate 5-7 day deload (50% volume cut) |
