\`\`\`
THE KAIZEN 3-POINT TRACKING MATRIX
1. Daily Weigh-Ins -> Calculate 7-Day Rolling Average (Filters daily noise)
2. Bi-Weekly Circumference Tape Measurements (Waist vs Chest/Arms/Quads)
3. Monthly Standardized Progress Photographs (Same lighting, time, and posture)
