- **The Impatience Exit**: Quitting at week 5 because the scale has not shifted and abs have not magically appeared. Cellular adaptation takes time; consistency compounds exponentially.
- **Comparing to Enhanced Influencers**: Measuring your natural progress against individuals using anabolic steroids, growth hormone, or image manipulation filters.

