Total Surplus: 22,500 kcal
├── Energy utilized for Muscle Synthesis (1.0 kg muscle): ~2,000 kcal  (9%)
└── Energy stored as Adipose Tissue (2.7 kg body fat):   ~20,500 kcal (91%)
