### Introduction
When fitness enthusiasts discuss nutrition, 95% of the conversation revolves around macronutrients: grams of protein, carbs, and fats. Yet, your body's biochemical machinery cannot utilize a single gram of amino acid or glucose without the presence of water, electrolytes, and essential micronutrients.

