### Scientific Background: The Catabolic Shift of Sleep Deprivation
In a landmark clinical study on sleep restriction and body composition (Nedeltcheva et al., Annals of Internal Medicine), researchers placed two groups of individuals on an identical moderate caloric deficit:
- **Group A slept 8.5 hours per night**.
