**The Case of Marcus's Stalled Bench Press**
Marcus had been progressing steadily on the dumbbell flat bench press for 7 weeks, moving from 16 kg to 22 kg dumbbells. In weeks 8 and 9, he failed to hit 8 reps with 22 kg; his shoulders felt achy, his grip felt weak, and his motivation dipped.

