- Marcus does NOT take the week off from the gym (complete bed rest causes detraining and stiffness).
- Instead, he performs his normal 3 workouts, but **cuts total volume by 50%** (e.g., 2 sets instead of 3-4 sets) and **stops all sets at 3-4 RIR** (using ~85% of his normal loads).
- He maintains his protein and calories at full maintenance.
