- **Skipping Deloads Out of Guilt**: Believing that taking a lighter recovery week will make you "lose all your gains." In reality, muscle atrophy does not begin until 2 to 3 weeks of complete cessation of training; a deload week simply unmasks your new muscle tissue.

### How to Measure Progress
