### Detailed Explanation
Why does pure recomposition slow down as you get more advanced? In an untrained beginner, the distance between their current muscular development and their genetic ceiling is vast, and their anabolic sensitivity is peak. The energetic surplus required for muscle synthesis can be drawn easily from adipose tissue.

As an intermediate lifter who has added 5 to 8 kg of muscle and dropped down to 13–15% body fat, two things change:
